# The MCP surface (denoise_mcp) runs on its own interpreter: the MCP SDK needs Python >= 3.10,
# while the REST service on these nodes runs on the system Python 3.9. Nothing from
# requirements-service.in belongs here, and nothing here belongs there; the only thing they share
# is numpy and the byte-pinned tables the core filter loads.
#
# Compiled for 3.12 (the deploy venv):
#   uv pip compile requirements-mcp.in --python-version 3.12 \
#      --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --generate-hashes --only-binary :all: \
#      -o requirements-mcp.lock
